00:53:07.360 --> 00:53:12.540
One with the companionship and unpredictable good times only a cat offers.
一种只有猫才能带来的陪伴和不可预知的快乐时光的生活。

1248
00:53:13.620 --> 00:53:14.460
Hmm.
